.TH sam-jail-group-set 1 2026-11-23 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM - Sandboxed AppImage Manager"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-group\-set \- Set one permission to the same value for several apps. Prints the settings from before as "previous", for `group restore`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail group set\fR [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIKEY\fR> <\fIVALUE\fR> <\fIAPPS\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set one permission to the same value for several apps. Prints the settings from before as "previous", for `group restore`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Only report what each app would lose; change nothing
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR
Confirm a change that adds something rated Think twice or Dangerous to any of the apps
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIKEY\fR>
Permission key, e.g. network.mode or filesystem.documents
.TP
<\fIVALUE\fR>
New value, e.g. none, ro, rw, true or false
.TP
<\fIAPPS\fR>

